VEHICLE DETECTION MODEL  (models/vehicle/weights/vehicle_rfdetr.onnx)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------
Trained on BMD-45 — Bengaluru Mobility Dataset
  Source:  https://huggingface.co/datasets/iisc-aim/BMD-45
  Author:  Artificial Intelligence and Mobility (AIM) Lab, IISc Bengaluru
  Licence: Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International (CC BY 4.0)
           https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/
  Changes: 14 fine-grained classes were merged into 8 operational classes;
           images re-encoded to a longest side of 1280 px.

